.TH tutr n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tutr \- Small tr\-like text transformation helpers.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::tutr::translate {abc cab} abc xyz
::tclutils::tutr::delete {a1b2c3} 0\-9
::tclutils::tutr::squeeze {aaabccc} ac
.fi
.PP
Commands:
.IP
\fBtranslate text set1 set2\fR
.IP
\fBdelete text set1\fR
.IP
\fBsqueeze text set1\fR
.IP
\fBfile path set1 set2 ?\-delete bool? ?\-squeeze bool?\fR
.PP
Character sets support literal characters and simple ranges like \fBa\-z\fR or \fB0\-9\fR.

